<h2><span class="mw-headline" id="Ornate_Fountain_by_mikemike37_-_1st_Place">Ornate Fountain by mikemike37 - 1st Place</span></h2>
<p><a rel="nofollow" class="external text" href="http://www.dragonagenexus.com/downloads/file.php?id=1720">DANexus Project Page</a>
</p><p>An elaborate fountain for rich towns' squares or perhaps mansion-like indoor levels. Support for lightmap. Has collision. Light probe reflection in the water. No low-LOD model. 6,000 polys.
</p><p>VFX is used to fire water out of the fish and add distortion and give the illusion of water - please don't give bonus points for the VFX, its just there because its kind of the point of the prop heh!
